{"data":[{"created_at":"2026-10-28T02:11:36.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2115265192447852868"],"id":"2115265192447852868","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":195,"impression_count":208263,"like_count":3850,"quote_count":25,"reply_count":222,"retweet_count":112},"text":"Pretty wild that Apple has spent basically 20 years telling us that touch-screen laptops are horrible due to ergonomics/arm fatigue and they are going to do it anyways tomorrow -- and not address the problem they proclaimed exists whatsoever. Either way I am pumped.","url":"https://x.com/i/status/2115265192447852868"},{"created_at":"2026-10-27T22:13:22.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2115205239435383190"],"id":"2115205239435383190","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":69,"impression_count":112619,"like_count":928,"quote_count":2,"reply_count":24,"retweet_count":26},"referenced_tweets":[{"id":"2115204306043593004","type":"quoted"}],"text":"I do not expect the current non-touch MacBook Pros (14 inch at $2499 and 16-inch at $2999) to go anywhere tomorrow. Retail stores are fully stocked up on those as well still. https://t.co/UTs2NJ1N3A","url":"https://x.com/i/status/2115205239435383190"},{"created_at":"2026-10-27T22:11:47.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2115204841442058258"],"id":"2115204841442058258","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":120,"impression_count":133497,"like_count":1648,"quote_count":10,"reply_count":71,"retweet_count":40},"referenced_tweets":[{"id":"2115204306043593004","type":"quoted"}],"text":"I’m still expecting M5 Pro and M5 Max chips, redesigned hinge for touch-screen stability, impressive OS changes for touch, new cooling system, slightly thinner and noticeably lighter design. Get excited. https://t.co/UTs2NJ1N3A","url":"https://x.com/i/status/2115204841442058258"},{"created_at":"2026-10-27T22:09:39.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2115204306043593004"],"id":"2115204306043593004","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":91,"impression_count":298542,"like_count":987,"quote_count":56,"reply_count":145,"retweet_count":66},"text":"NEW: Apple bets customers will pay a big premium for touch-screen, OLED laptops. The company has discussed charging $400 more, pricing the 14-inch touch MacBook Pro from $2,899. That could make the 16-inch model at least $3,399. https://t.co/f8DjKUXqHB","url":"https://x.com/i/status/2115204306043593004"},{"created_at":"2026-10-27T15:22:27.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2115101831051571471"],"id":"2115101831051571471","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":159,"impression_count":125569,"like_count":1394,"quote_count":1,"reply_count":28,"retweet_count":17},"referenced_tweets":[{"id":"2115068016283324914","type":"quoted"}],"text":"That’s so nice of them!!! 🙃🙃🙃 https://t.co/hNWZ9dXMkB","url":"https://x.com/i/status/2115101831051571471"},{"created_at":"2026-10-27T13:16:50.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2115070215361024395"],"id":"2115070215361024395","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":24,"impression_count":72155,"like_count":599,"quote_count":3,"reply_count":18,"retweet_count":20},"referenced_tweets":[{"id":"2115066787838722358","type":"quoted"}],"text":"Apple Launches M6 iMac, Entry MacBook Pro Ahead of Touch Laptop https://t.co/UeWICamFAh https://t.co/USUGjQAA79","url":"https://x.com/i/status/2115070215361024395"},{"created_at":"2026-10-27T13:15:36.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2115069908493234661"],"id":"2115069908493234661","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":43,"impression_count":87875,"like_count":1165,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":24,"retweet_count":37},"referenced_tweets":[{"id":"2115066787838722358","type":"quoted"}],"text":"Other than the new chip: Bluetooth 6, WiFi 7 and faster charging on the MacBook Pro. Oct. 28 pre-orders and Nov. 6 availability. https://t.co/USUGjQAA79","url":"https://x.com/i/status/2115069908493234661"},{"created_at":"2026-10-27T13:03:12.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2115066787838722358"],"id":"2115066787838722358","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":109,"impression_count":386796,"like_count":